<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλλόγ-ιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>held in account</i> or
				<i>regard</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν λόγῳ</span>), <i>in
				high repute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.176
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				327c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Smp.</u>
				197a
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐπὶ σοφίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					361e
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				1.9.1
			</span></i>,al. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.11.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν τινός</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				33.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>eloquent</i>, Men.Rh.<i><span class="en">
				p.354
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.125
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>
			<u>Gloss.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλλογος</span>
			, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλογος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Corp.Herm.</u>
				12.6
			</span></i>.</div>
